  "title": "The Modifier Gets to Work",
  "description": "Inside the mod parlor, electronic music blared, and Boba Fett came face to face with The Modifier. Boba placed Fennec Shand on one of the beds, and informed the craftsman that she needed help. Scoffing at Fett's age, the electronic artisan initially turns him down, but when Fett plunked down a bag of credits, his tone changed. Firing up his tools, the Modifier got to work on Shand. Where once there was a deadly blaster wound, the area was then filled with life-saving cybernetics."
